//! Run focused RealWorld tests from the shared src/ SOURCE root.
//! src/tests/ may import sibling ../app/ modules through this entry.
//!
//! Start here to learn the application through assertions rather than sockets.
//! `make test` grants Entropy/Clock to this RootActor entry, which forwards them
//! explicitly to the suite. Importing a test module executes its top-level
//! assertions; the secure-auth module instead exports run(entropy, clock).
//! START/LOADED markers help distinguish import failures from assertion failures.

print("REALWORLD_TEST_ENTRY=START")
Suite: import("./tests/main.protos")
print("REALWORLD_TEST_SUITE=LOADED")
Suite.run(print, entropy, clock)
true
